{"parse": {"title": "风暴里，雏鹰振翅-08", "pageid": 140252, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E9%87%8C%EF%BC%8C%E9%9B%8F%E9%B9%B0%E6%8C%AF%E7%BF%85-07\" title=\"风暴里，雏鹰振翅-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">风暴里，雏鹰振翅-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">风暴里，雏鹰振翅</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.BB.8A.E6.97.A5.E6.97.A0.E4.BA.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"今日无事\">今日无事</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 今日无事</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Day Like Any Other</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3154 pic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_3154_pic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">拉普拉斯科算中心·“暴雨”观测中心</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p>小春雀儿抱着一沓文件踏入了“暴雨”观测中心的大门。另外几个同僚正围在屏幕前指指点点，完全无暇顾及刚刚出现的实习生。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“发生了什么？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅰ：</b></span>“你看洛伦兹蝴蝶的新文章了吗？“暴雨”临界点预测拟合度比我们高百分之三十以上！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅱ：</b></span>“……也许我们该直接采用她的推算结论。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅰ：</b></span>“别气馁！你没听到消息吗？马上我们会有一大笔新的预算，到时至少可以兴建二十座全新的采样站。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅰ：</b></span>“等到全球采样站的数据返回，我们的‘暴雨’观测将会变得更加准确！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅱ：</b></span>“可是，不知道为什么，那个洛伦兹蝴蝶总是能拿到我们的数据……小春雀儿，你说她到底是怎么办到的？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“呃……说不定这位洛伦兹蝴蝶是个寄宿在我们设备晶体管里的幽灵。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>研究员Ⅱ：</b></span>“不是没有可能，我们得找反幽灵部门聊聊。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“还有，您的数据资料。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>把手中的资料交给研究员们，小春雀儿一溜烟离开了充满议论声的“暴雨”观测中心。玛格丽特女士不在工位上，当然啦，玛格丽特女士总是很忙。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">拉普拉斯科算中心·试验场</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3154 pic 19.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png/110px-Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png/165px-Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png/220px-Rolestory_3154_pic_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a></div>\n<p>拉普拉斯科算中心的试验场总是显得残破不堪，那些脑海中不停冒出奇怪点子的天才们总是把自己的新主意放在这里进行验证。当然，这里的惨状也证明了新主意不一定是好主意。<br />\n小春雀儿摆弄着手上的探测器。这些日子里，在老师和X先生的指导下，她尝试着给自己的武器加装各种各样的新功能。不过，她也驳回了一些建议，比如让探测器兼具泡泡机的功能。<br />\n面熟的实习生看到兴冲冲完成调试的小春雀儿，露出了惊讶的神情。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>实习生Ⅰ：</b></span>“小春雀儿？我记得你是在‘暴雨’观测中心吧？你在测试……这是快速文书生成机吗？”她的面上露出怜悯的神色，“我明白了，这一定是为了应付烦人的基金会。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“我们确实需要这个功能……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>实习生Ⅰ：</b></span>“那这个是……武器吗？天啊，现在的世道是真的乱，对吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“啊哈哈……总得做好万全的准备。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>小春雀儿：</b></span>“就当作是我的小爱好吧——好了，午休结束了，我得回去继续整理观测数据了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">洛伦兹研究所</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3154 pic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png/110px-Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png/165px-Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png/220px-Rolestory_3154_pic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<p>洛伦兹研究所里，属于小春雀儿的新座位上，一台崭新的仪器伫立着，还扎着漂亮的缎带。<br />\n这不是什么高精尖的神秘学设备，也不是什么辅助分析的计算单元。<br />\n小春雀儿认得这个仪器，这是一台混沌摆。<br />\n混沌摆上插着一张<span class=\"tooltips\" style=\"cursor: help; color: #ff7a06;\">卡片<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left; translate: 0px;\">世界是一个如此混沌的系统，但它总该具备一些初始条件。<br />比如……那只位于巴西的蝴蝶，总是会在所有的理论里一次又一次地扇动翅膀。<br />又比如，破壳的雏鹰总会学着振翅，那它也一定会引发属于自己的风暴。——M</span></span>。<br />\n小春雀儿拨动桌面上的混沌摆，这小小的结构毫无规律的运动了起来。无序，混沌，无法被总结。<br />\n</p>\n可是，小春雀儿知道，这一切都源于自己的轻轻一推。<br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "风暴里，雏鹰振翅-08"}}